 l'ambiance du départ et de partir plus vite que prévu. Respecte ton allure dès les premiers kilomètres et laisse la course venir à toi. Si tu gères bien le début, tu pourras accélérer ou maintenir ton effort jusqu'à l'arrivée sans subir. Fais confiance à ton plan, à ton entraînement et aux sensations que tu as travaillées pendant les séances spécifiques. Bonne course !","displayName":"10 BORNES","coachAdvice":"L'équipe CAMPUS te souhaite bon courage pour ta compétition ! On est tous derrière toi :)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Competition","trainingCategory":"road_competition","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"course","value":246,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"race"},"durations":[{"value":2460,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a7dba14afd2719931e92b84","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1791158400000,"sessionIndex":3,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["liquid","semi-liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":500,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":30,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":2050,"metric":"mg"}}}],[{"datoId":"UMD5Rt1ESQ25KBXonqCm0A","name":"Jus de pomme","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":280,"metric":"mL"},"waterQuantity":{"value":220,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":30.8,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":5.6,"metric":"mg"}}}],[{"datoId":"AILrY6kmTTaa9W-jLuoFFQ","name":"Jus de raisin","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":200,"metric":"mL"},"waterQuantity":{"value":300,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":30,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":10,"metric":"mg"}}}]],"commercial":[[{"datoId":"DcjMZ0kQTV6TCPfZj1KbpA","name":"Boisson d’effort aux fruits","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity